        "modifier": "img-to-left",
        "updated_info": false,
        "heading": "<h2><strong>02. Sorry, \"the clinic's too expensive\" stops being a reason.</strong></h2>",
        "text": "<p>The microneedling facial that actually works runs £300+ a session. Then there's the booking, the travel, the afternoon spent flushed in public.</p><p>You knew it worked. You just couldn't justify it every month.</p><p>Same gold-plated needle method. Sealed serum. </p><p>Single-use head. Delivered through micro-channels instead of applied on top. Except it's your bathroom, your bedroom, your schedule. Under £25 a treatment.</p><p>It won't replace everything a clinic does. But the absorption, the glow, the upkeep, for a fraction of the price.</p><p><strong>Under £25 a treatment versus £300+ in-clinic.</strong> No appointment. No waiting room.*</p>"
      }
    },
    "n_mi_faq_page_qa_img_mobile_m7bRLM": {
      "type": "n_mi-faq-page-qa-img-mobile",
      "name": "t:sections.n_mi-faq-page-qa-img-mobile.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "modifier": "none",
        "heading": "<h2><strong>03. Sorry, it was never the ingredient. It was the delivery.</strong></h2>",
        "text": "<p>Every cream, serum, and moisturiser you've bought had the same problem. Not the ingredients. The format.</p><p>Your skin blocks almost anything larger than 500 Daltons. That's the number dermatologists work with. A collagen molecule is about 300,000.</p><p>It can't get in. Not slowly. Can't. It sits on top, feels nice for an hour, then rinses onto your pillow.*</p><p>Micro-Infusion works on a different principle. 24K gold-plated 0.5mm needles open thousands of tiny channels and deliver the serum underneath the barrier, where your skin can actually use it. </p><p>Five minutes. Every two weeks.</p><p>This is what Rita found. Not a better cream. A better way in.*</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Micro-Infusion_B-roll_Female-0.00.webp",
        "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/Micro-Infusion_B-roll_Female-0.00.webp"
      }
    },
