        "updated_info": false,
        "heading": "<h2><strong>04. Sorry, you're going to get asked what you're using.</strong></h2>",
        "text": "<p>Rita's husband wasn't the only one. This is what Qure customers keep telling us happens.</p><p>A 57-year-old whose skin had gone dry and lifeless did three treatments. Her coworkers started asking what she was using.*<br/>A 65-year-old man came back from holiday. One of his employees walked into his office and screamed \"oh my god, you look so young.\"*<br/>A woman with rosacea and hyperpigmentation that showed through foundation did three treatments. </p><p>Her skin looked clearer without foundation than it used to look with it.*</p><p><strong>87% saw smoother lines and wrinkles after twelve weeks.</strong> 91% reported more even tone and smoothness.* </p><p>But the result that keeps coming back isn't a percentage. <strong>It's someone else noticing before you've said a word.</strong></p>"
      }
    },
    "n_mi_faq_page_qa_img_mobile_CamYWx": {
      "type": "n_mi-faq-page-qa-img-mobile",
      "name": "t:sections.n_mi-faq-page-qa-img-mobile.name",
      "settings": {
        "use_own_file": false,
        "modifier": "img-to-top",
        "heading": "<h2><strong>05. Sorry, you're about to need a lot less makeup. </strong></h2>",
        "text": "<p>You've noticed the foundation getting heavier. A bit more concealer every year. Not because you want to wear more makeup but because your skin needs more covering.</p><p>One Qure customer said her redness and pigmentation used to be visible even through foundation. Three treatments in, her skin looked clearer without it than it used to look with it.*</p><p>Another put it simply: \"My favourite concealers are collecting dust.\"*</p><p>When your skin is hydrated and renewed from underneath, makeup becomes a choice again… </p><p>Not a requirement.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/MI_1.5_wrinkles_3monthkit1-0.00.webp",
        "image_mobile": "shopify://shop_images/MI_1.5_wrinkles_3monthkit1-0.00.webp"
      }
