        "modifier": "img-to-left",
        "updated_info": false,
        "heading": "<h2><strong>Why every cream she'd tried did nothing...</strong></h2>",
        "text": "<p>The industry sells better ingredients in the one format that can't get them in. Beta Glucan, copper peptides, vitamin C, PDRN. All applied to a barrier built to block them.<br/><br/>The Qure Micro-Infusion System is designed to revitalize your skin through a precise and effective process:</p><p><strong>Micro-Needles:</strong> Tiny, gold needles (thinner than a human hair) create micro-channels in your skin. This helps stimulate collagen production and triggers your skin’s natural healing process.</p><p><strong>Serum Delivery:</strong> The micro-channels allow our scientifically-backed serums to penetrate deeply, delivering active ingredients exactly where they are needed to reduce the appearance of wrinkles, fine lines, and dark spots.</p><p><strong>Hydration and Plumping:</strong> The infusion process enhances your skin's ability to retain moisture, resulting in a plumper, more hydrated, and radiant looking complexion.</p><p>Use the Qure Micro-Infusion System for just 5 minutes every 2 weeks for a minimum of 3 months and <strong>enjoy smoother looking more youthful skin</strong> and a more confident you.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/mi_needle.webp"
      }
    },
