        "heading": "<h2>Is the Qure Micro-Infusion System Safe?</h2>",
        "text": "<p>Yes, the Qure Micro-Infusion System is very safe to use. It has been thoroughly tested and reviewed by leading dermatologists to ensure it meets the highest safety standards.</p><p>Our device uses gentle, 24k gold micro-needles and carefully formulated serums to provide effective results with minimal risk of irritation. You can confidently incorporate it into your skincare routine, knowing it’s designed with your skin’s health in mind.</p>"
      }
    },
