        "modifier": "none",
        "updated_info": true,
        "heading": "<h6><strong>Last apology.</strong></h6>",
        "text": "<p><strong>Actually, we're not sorry. <br/>Not about the husband who won't stop commenting. Not about the serums collecting dust. Not about the concealer with nothing left to do.</strong></p><p><strong>Five minutes. Every two weeks.</strong></p>"
      }
