            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Akina M.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "text": "<h6>It really works!!</h6><p>“I used three time so far. I can see the results from first time I used. I love this product but only thing is it’s take time to apply till used all serum per application. I tried many different way to press to my skin so the serum come out more but then a lot of time not.”</p>",
