            "flag": "shopify://shop_images/america_f.webp",
            "username": "Jess.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "text": "<h6>It really works!!</h6><p>“I committed to the 3 month saver bundle and after 6 treatments (2 weeks apart) I’m SO happy with the results!!! My pores are smaller and I have mainly noticed a difference in my skin texture. My skin goes a little red straight after the treatment but that quickly goes away. It’s a little uncomfortable when I do it on my forehead but it’s fine everywhere else. Totally worth it!!!”</p>",
