            "username": "Jennifer N.",
            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "text": "<h6>Works better than I imagined!</h6><p>“I am really stunned by how well this product works. I have had professional micro-needling and I wanted the benefits without the downtime. I did my treatment, went to bed and woke up the next morning and was ready to go. My skin looks better than it has in years.”</p>",
