            "verified_customer": "Verified customer",
            "text": "<h6>Give it a try!</h6><p>“I tried the Micro-Infusion because I’ve been working on the dark spots on my face for quite some time. After a couple of uses my face seems plumper, is glowing and the dark spots seem not as dark. Give it a try!”</p>",
